1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:06,480
Meet BeFocus — a free app that helps you take back control of your phone, and your time.

2
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:12,571
Most of us lose hours every day to endless reels, shorts and distracting apps.

3
00:00:12,571 --> 00:00:15,294
Adult content is always one tap away.

4
00:00:15,294 --> 00:00:22,100
And most blockers are easy to switch off in a weak moment, so they don’t really help.

5
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:23,823
BeFocus solves this.

6
00:00:23,823 --> 00:00:38,449
It blocks the apps you choose on a schedule or after a daily limit, blocks reels and shorts while the rest of the app keeps working, filters adult websites and keywords, and protects itself from being uninstalled.

7
00:00:38,449 --> 00:00:44,080
Turning it off takes forty-eight hours, or a code from a friend you trust.

8
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:45,815
Let’s install it.

9
00:00:45,815 --> 00:00:51,924
BeFocus isn’t on the Play Store yet, so we’ll download the APK from GitHub.

10
00:00:51,924 --> 00:00:58,767
Open Chrome, search Google for “BeFocus APK GitHub”, and tap the befocus-apk result.

11
00:00:58,767 --> 00:01:02,820
You can also type the link shown on screen.

12
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:08,161
On the GitHub page, tap the BeFocus APK file, then tap Download.

13
00:01:08,161 --> 00:01:16,894
Chrome may warn that this type of file can be harmful — it shows this for every APK from outside the Play Store.

14
00:01:16,894 --> 00:01:19,160
Tap “Download anyway”.

15
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:21,448
Open the downloaded file.

16
00:01:21,448 --> 00:01:26,099
Android will ask for permission to install apps from Chrome.

17
00:01:26,099 --> 00:01:31,300
Tap Settings, turn on “Allow from this source”, and go back.

18
00:01:31,650 --> 00:01:32,558
Tap Install.

19
00:01:32,558 --> 00:01:39,442
Because BeFocus is new and not from the Play Store, Google Play Protect may show a warning.

20
00:01:39,442 --> 00:01:42,619
Tap “More details”, then “Install anyway”.

21
00:01:42,619 --> 00:01:52,020
Play Protect often flags new blocker apps like this, because they use accessibility and device admin to do their job.

22
00:01:52,370 --> 00:02:00,929
If you don’t see “Install anyway”, open the Play Store, tap your profile picture, then Play Protect, then the settings icon.

23
00:02:00,929 --> 00:02:09,210
Turn off “Scan apps with Play Protect”, install BeFocus, and then turn scanning back on to keep your phone safe.

24
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:19,892
On Android 13 and newer, apps installed from outside the Play Store start with restricted settings, so the Accessibility switch may be greyed out.

25
00:02:19,892 --> 00:02:23,430
To fix it, open Settings, then Apps, then BeFocus.

26
00:02:23,430 --> 00:02:32,330
Tap the three-dot menu at the top right, choose “Allow restricted settings”, and confirm with your PIN or fingerprint.

27
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:35,830
Now open BeFocus and tap “Get started”.

28
00:02:35,830 --> 00:02:39,707
The permissions screen shows what BeFocus needs.

29
00:02:39,707 --> 00:02:44,149
Accessibility and Display over other apps are required.

30
00:02:44,149 --> 00:02:50,852
Device admin, unrestricted battery and notifications are optional, but recommended.

31
00:02:50,852 --> 00:02:53,260
Let’s turn on each one.

32
00:02:53,610 --> 00:02:55,666
Accessibility comes first.

33
00:02:55,666 --> 00:03:03,255
It lets BeFocus see which app, reel or website is on screen, so it can block the ones you chose.

34
00:03:03,255 --> 00:03:05,943
Read the notice and tap “I agree”.

35
00:03:05,943 --> 00:03:12,900
In Accessibility settings, open Downloaded apps, tap BeFocus, turn it on, and tap Allow.

36
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:18,510
Everything stays on your phone — nothing is collected or shared.

37
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:21,352
Next, Display over other apps.

38
00:03:21,352 --> 00:03:26,668
This lets BeFocus show its focus screen on top of a blocked app.

39
00:03:26,668 --> 00:03:32,950
Tap Allow, find BeFocus, and turn on “Allow display over other apps”.

40
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:37,307
Device admin is used only for uninstall protection.

41
00:03:37,307 --> 00:03:41,470
It stops BeFocus from being removed in a weak moment.

42
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:45,870
Tap Allow, then “Activate this device admin app”.

43
00:03:46,220 --> 00:03:47,150
Now battery.

44
00:03:47,150 --> 00:03:53,119
Many phones stop background apps to save power, which would stop the blocker.

45
00:03:53,119 --> 00:03:59,553
Tap Allow, and choose Allow when Android asks to let BeFocus run in the background.

46
00:03:59,553 --> 00:04:06,770
On some phones, also open App info, then App battery usage, and select “Unrestricted”.

47
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:12,066
Finally, allow notifications for your daily focus summary.

48
00:04:12,066 --> 00:04:15,051
All five permissions now show “On”.

49
00:04:15,051 --> 00:04:16,710
Tap Continue.

50
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:19,707
Next, add an accountability partner.

51
00:04:19,707 --> 00:04:29,414
Your friend scans this QR code with an authenticator app, such as Google Authenticator, and tells you the six-digit code to confirm.

52
00:04:29,414 --> 00:04:36,033
Later, if you really need to turn protection off, their current code unlocks it instantly.

53
00:04:36,033 --> 00:04:40,480
Without a partner, you simply wait forty-eight hours.

54
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:42,603
This is your home screen.

55
00:04:42,603 --> 00:04:55,490
Everything starts off, so open Shields and turn on what you need: Reels and Shorts, short-video apps, the adult content filter, your own block list, and uninstall protection.

56
00:04:55,840 --> 00:05:01,390
To block an app, go to Apps, tap Add, and pick an app, like Instagram.

57
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:07,335
Choose the days and a from-to time, for example weekdays from nine to five.

58
00:05:07,335 --> 00:05:11,616
Or switch to a daily limit, like thirty minutes a day.

59
00:05:11,616 --> 00:05:12,880
Tap Save.

60
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:22,488
Reels and Shorts are blocked inside Instagram, YouTube, Facebook and Snapchat, while messages and the rest of each app keep working.

61
00:05:22,488 --> 00:05:31,044
The adult filter covers more than fifty thousand websites and keywords, in every browser and in the search box of any app.

62
00:05:31,044 --> 00:05:34,890
You can add your own websites and keywords too.

63
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:40,521
When something is blocked, you see this focus screen for sixty seconds.

64
00:05:40,521 --> 00:05:45,132
It can’t be skipped — Home and Recents bring it straight back.

65
00:05:45,132 --> 00:05:52,198
The “Why was this blocked?” card tells you exactly what triggered it, and which setting did it.

66
00:05:52,198 --> 00:05:55,247
The ad on this screen keeps BeFocus free.

67
00:05:55,247 --> 00:05:59,070
Phone calls and emergency calls always work.

68
00:05:59,420 --> 00:06:05,954
With uninstall protection on, BeFocus’s app info and uninstall screens are blocked too.

69
00:06:05,954 --> 00:06:09,934
To change or remove protection, open Lock and unlock.

70
00:06:09,934 --> 00:06:15,566
Either enter your partner’s current code, or start a forty-eight hour wait.

71
00:06:15,566 --> 00:06:18,820
Most cravings pass long before that.

72
00:06:19,170 --> 00:06:21,922
BeFocus works entirely on your phone.

73
00:06:21,922 --> 00:06:25,567
It doesn’t collect or share what you see or type.

74
00:06:25,567 --> 00:06:31,100
Download it today from the link on screen, and take back your time.

